  "contracts": [
    "Three movement leaves are full ordinary C in old generated/mixed/artifacts/actor_civic_followup/ActorRouteLeaves.c. Current runtime ActorLaborer entrypoints delegate to those algorithms; do not migrate only the wrapper. Reuse full algorithms with actual typed record fields4A..58. Volatile accesses preserve original publication/reload order.",
    "4B4180 captures BYTE axis and WORD error, tests error signed16, computes doubled WORD component/difference modulo16, stores lowWORD error then reloads and decrements the actual selected delta WORD. Native upper scratch EDX/ECX are not needed for the lowWORD stores and are not invented API inputs.",
    "4B43A0/43E0 capture each signed current/target WORD once. INC/DEC wraps only its stored WORD, with no write when equal. Shared private step helper receives actual field pointers and gets no second Native owner credit.",
    "4B4420 reuses whole old Targeting.c projectile-path parent with real scratch walker0 and actual4B4220/4180/43A0/43E0 children. Initial and target pixel LEAs multiply32 by15 with wrap before WORD stores/child calls. Grid offset is wrapped base+x+228*y. Preserve real base DWORD snapshot before initial writes and reload at each later terrain test, rather than a synthesized map origin.",
    "Path executes1000 segments of8 motion steps, checks signed delta sum before each step, stores tile coordinates using signed divide15, skips first6 terrain checks only when starting onC000 wall/gate mask. Terrain is DWORD; initial maskC000, blocking maskC001, building8 plus BYTE bitfields maskF. Scratch state survives every early0/1 return. Native full EAX is defined0/1.",
    "4B46B0 reuses full old Targeting.c/current Unit01443 C: signed targetWORD82>0, target stateBYTE0E==1, actionBYTE38!=4 and WORD sequence86==expected88. Native explicitly forms full EAX0/1. Do not add a new upper bound, no-op or zeroed input frame. This corrects the stale map row outside game/; old Original public is absent from canonical library.",
    "Compiled Release has exactly one definition of each5 canonical public owner. Optimizer inlines the actual three movement C leaves into the path; actual setup remains a real canonical C call. No original IL path or placeholder callback. Record offset/size assertions compile in both canonical and foreign worktree builds."
  ],
